# Density Compare
# Lead (Pb) — real density 11.34 g/cm³. equal masses: Lead vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Lead Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.9mm material: lead at (-20mm, 4.4mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 90.4 g — the water cube is the reference
